{"title":"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given that\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/9/d29e6d13e0d8b213ee70519a8250268a6a19a4c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{((3!)!)!}{3!} = k \\cdot n!,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"124\" height=\"38\" /></center>\n<p>where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integer\" title=\"Positive integer\">positive integers</a> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is as large as possible, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/a/38a647c7a556707737f97dd4f06a1bf7c8468389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k + n.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/8/868eddc32a5e4c6b77ab9b1510ff91597ff430c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[{{\\left((3!)!\\right)!}\\over{3!}}= {{(6!)!}\\over{6}}={{720!}\\over6}={{720\\cdot719!}\\over6}=120\\cdot719!.\\]\" width=\"378\" height=\"38\" />Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/a/b0a02689e1592c7c3a7e76563f9a73bd20514213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120\\cdot719!&lt;720!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"127\" height=\"13\" />, we can conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/0/d50a55c0c767b352fb11878a134d4d4a65bcc566.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &lt; 720$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, the maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/9/8497265bfcc0e950b9f0f357a9f335ce8e66590d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$719$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. The requested value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/c/72c9bea668f84e83795d27b6eb8d4c49e8f4c093.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87e61569f63af387347b795bc135df9b39a9651b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120+719=\\boxed{839}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~yofro\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I\" title=\"2003 AIME I\">2003 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2003\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2003 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017071731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 132/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1756/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 115/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0